{"id":"527303128","kind":"article","title":"如何将助记媒介中得到的理解，应用到侧重深刻情感联系的形式上？","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6kCeJmanzXswfjDoushes6JT5yRELWmVB76g"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"助记媒介 & 思想工具","date":"2022-06-11","updated":"2022-07-03","votes":8,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":527,"keywords":["助记媒介","情感投入","学习工具","助记视频","叙事学习"],"summary":"译文提出一个媒介设计问题：能否把助记媒介的理解支持，与优秀电影、电子游戏所具备的深层情感联系结合起来？作者举“助记视频”作为早期设想。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/527303128","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":3,"title":"参考资料"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-3","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"QGRUEIGU\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4rRX3qwSSJRsEkdXKwH2shamgHNeRthrMLiF\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>在很多方面太过干瘪且强调认知。如果我们从侧重深度情感联系的创制经验（比如最好的电影和电子游戏）开始，并将它们与建立更深层次理解的方法相融合，我们可以发明什么媒介？</p><p data-pid=\"kbbtwset\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://numinous.productions/ttft/#mnemonic-video\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记视频</a>是其中一个早期的想法。</p><p data-pid=\"97wceO-D\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zWiPabJxBUe2LyKaegZRLNQYAE653PXewkhU\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">认真对待情感</a>的一部分</p><hr/><h3 id=\"sec-1\">参考资料</h3><p data-pid=\"6BTsVTP4\">Matuschak, A., &amp; Nielsen, M. (2019, October 0). <i>How can we develop transformative tools for thought?</i> <sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup><a class=\"external\" href=\"https://numinous.productions/ttft\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"visible\">numinous.productions/tt</span><span class=\"invisible\">ft</span><span class=\"ellipsis\"></span></a></p><h2 id=\"sec-2\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"U